# ---- ART: raw generation output stays LOCAL --------------------------------------------------
# These are Codex's working folders, not deliverables. `overnight/animation-raw` alone is 263 MB
# and NOTHING in the game ever requests it -- ART_PATH is 'Art/sprites/' and only that. A blanket
# `git add -A` swept 451 MB of them into a PUBLIC repo's history on 2026-09-04 and it took a
# force-push to undo. The game needs Art/sprites/; the reworkable masters (batch2, current-cast,
# rework-v2) are small and stay tracked. These two are not.
Art/masters/**/overnight/
Art/masters/**/attempts/
